# Outside Plasma, Dolphin takes its colors from its own color scheme setting and the
# rest of the Qt look (style, fonts, icons) from qt6ct
# libadwaita apps take dark or light from the portal setting, not from settings.ini;
# GTK 3 apps need the adw-gtk3 theme picked here too
